{"id":"n83639-7-7","stage":2,"title":"풀어지다 · 回暖","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83639-7-7-1","ko":"요즘 날씨가 많이 풀어졌지요?","zh":"最近天气变暖和多了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"풀어졌지요?","meaning":"回暖","explanation":"풀어지다：回暖；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"풀어지다","audio":"/audio/eadf666457bae49c71d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83639","senseId":"7","lemma":"풀어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"eadf666457bae49c","term":"풀어지다","zh":"回暖","audio":"/audio/eadf666457bae49c71d5.mp3","entryId":"83639","definition":"寒冷的天气变暖。","pronunciation":["푸러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe60fffca1c9f78a489f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83639-7-7-2","ko":"네, 그래서 오늘 옷을 얇게 입고 나온걸요.","zh":"是的，所以今天我才穿得比较轻便的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얇게","meaning":"薄","explanation":"얇다：薄；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"얇다","audio":"/audio/7dbc70519003a2d1bb2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89859","senseId":"1","lemma":"얇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입고","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나온걸요.","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"나오다：到，来到；ㄴ걸요：礼貌地表示发现、感叹或与对方预期不同的情况。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"3","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"7dbc70519003a2d1","term":"얇다","zh":"薄","audio":"/audio/7dbc70519003a2d1bb2d.mp3","entryId":"89859","definition":"厚度不厚。","pronunciation":["얄ː따"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"为了一定目的来某处。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7f3b5e65a91c9912128c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.127,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83639","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"7","sourceLevel":"중급","day":72,"sequenceScore":1.9537,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，所以今天我才穿得比较轻便的。","最近天气变暖和多了吧？","浑身酸痛好些了吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近天气变暖和多了吧？","浑身酸痛好些了吗？","是的，所以今天我才穿得比较轻便的。"],"answer":2}]}
